<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Delek Q3 net 26.64 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel's Delek Q3 net 26.64 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delek the Israel Fuel Corp reported the following third-quarter results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>				 (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			  Q3 96     Q3 95    9-MTH 96    9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		 896,626   846,954  2,737,658   2,269,182</p>
<p>Operating profit     45,541    21,885    141,600	56,839</p>
<p>Net Profit	     26,639    25,159     80,639	78,457</p>
<p>($1 = 3.24 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
